# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Alchemy --out` from Forever's client tables, trainer lists and data/forever. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/alchemy
title Alchemy 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Alchemy turns herbs into elixirs, potions and oils. Herbalism is its partner: every reagent below
# is a herb, a vial from an alchemy or trade supplies vendor, or (three times) a fish.
#
# Forever's changes: the healing potions moved to First Aid. Alchemy keeps a Discolored healing line
# that needs a Murloc Eye per potion (a drop) and has no confirmed learn skill, so this route leaves
# it out. New: Minor Arcane Elixir and Elixir of Minor Force (orange to 10), Elixir of Minor
# Fortitude at 50 (trainer), Cerulean Dye and Sulfuric Acid at 40 (Frilled Lichen and Pyrite are
# scarce finds while gathering), Magenta and Viridian Dye, and dozens of new elixirs that are only
# five points wide or sold for Merchant's Favor by Apothecary Durelle near the Crossroads. Several
# Classic recipes kept their spell but changed name: Elixir of Lion's Strength is Elixir of Minor
# Strength, Elixir of Greater Defense is Elixir of Defense, Elixir of Superior Defense is Elixir of
# Greater Defense, Elixir of Detect Undead is Draught of Detect Undead.
#
# Camping: Mana Well (skill 20) is the Alchemy camp item. The Fermenter (skill 140) is a camp
# station from a blueprint that Rath'mael drops in the Ruins of Lordaeron; Shadow Oil, Frost Oil,
# Goblin Rocket Fuel, Ghost Dye and Viridian Dye need it, so this route leaves them out. The
# skill-300 Alchemy Laboratory (flasks) has no known blueprint source yet.
#
# Ranks: trainers teach by tier and train only from their tier's skill: Journeyman at the city
# trainers, from skill 50; Expert only at Ainethil (Darnassus) and Doctor Herbert Halsey
# (Undercity), from 125; Artisan only at Kylanna Windwhisper (Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas) and
# Rogvar (Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows), from 200. Alchemy has no specialisation. Transmutes and the
# Philosopher's Stone come from Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.
#
# The route keeps to trainer recipes from 75 to 265. Holy Protection Potion (100) and Shadow
# Protection Potion (135) would cost about the same, but their recipes come from limited-stock
# sellers (Kzixx, Xandar Goodbeard and Hula'mahi; Harklan Moongrove and Christoph Jeffcoat) and bind
# when picked up, and Holy Protection takes a Swiftthistle per craft, a find on about two Briarthorn
# in five.
#
# Route (crafts are expected counts; yellow and green crafts can take more):
#     1-75  Elixir of Minor Defense, about 82 (known): 1 Silverleaf, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial each
#    75-90  Minor Mana Potion, about 28 (trainer 1s): 1 Mageroyal, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial each
#    90-135 Elixir of Wisdom, about 49 (trainer): 1 Mageroyal, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Empty Vial each
#   135-150 Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir, about 15 (trainer): 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial each
#   150-160 Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir, about 12 (trainer): 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial each
#   160-195 Mana Potion, about 39 (trainer): 1 Stranglekelp, 1 Kingsblood and 1 Leaded Vial each
#   195-225 Elixir of Defense, about 32 (trainer): 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial each
#   225-230 Elixir of Defense, about 8 (trainer): 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial each
#   230-265 Draught of Detect Undead, about 43 (trainer): 1 Arthas' Tears and 1 Crystal Vial each
#   265-300 Elixir of Greater Defense, about 43 (recipe 1g 30s): 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass and 1 Crystal Vial each
#
# Shopping per bracket (vendor goods at vendor prices; gathered or dropped materials by count):
# 1-75: Apprentice 10c, vendor goods 3s 28c; gather or buy 82 Silverleaf and 110 Peacebloom.
# 75-150: Journeyman 4s 50c (Classic price), recipes 1s plus unpriced trainer recipes, vendor goods
# 9s 8c; gather or buy 77 Mageroyal, 152 Briarthorn and 54 Bruiseweed.
# 150-225: Expert 50s (Classic price), trainer recipes (prices not in the data), vendor goods 33s
# 20c; gather or buy 40 Wild Steelbloom, 39 Kingsblood, 39 Stranglekelp and 40 Goldthorn.
# 225-300: Artisan 4g 50s (Classic price), recipes 1g 30s plus unpriced trainer recipes, vendor
# goods 4g 50s 40c; gather or buy 43 Arthas' Tears, 43 Sungrass and 43 Stonescale Eel.
#
# Data: recipes, colours and reagents from the Forever client's tables; trainer learn skills and
# prices from Forever's sniffed trainer lists (they reach skill 50-150); vendors, stock and drops
# from data/forever. Materials are valued at about four times their vendor sell price (cloth and
# leather by the square root of it, hides four times higher; tools/lib/professions/materials.js) to
# rank recipes against each other, never as a price forecast.
# ASSUMED: learn skills of Elixir of Wisdom 90, Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir 125, Mana Potion 160,
# Elixir of Defense 195, Draught of Detect Undead 230 and Stonescale Oil 250 (no sniffed Forever
# list teaches them: Classic's trainer skill moved as far as Forever moved the recipe's colours,
# which the sniffed lists bear out on 126 of 129 recipes). In-game check: the skill the trainer
# asks; their prices are not in the data.
# ASSUMED: rank level gates Journeyman 10, Expert 20 and Artisan 35 (Classic's; Forever's sniffed
# lists ask level 1 for Apprentice). In-game check: the level each trainer asks.
# ASSUMED: rank prices Journeyman 4s 50c, Expert 50s and Artisan 4g 50s (Classic's trainer lists;
# Forever's sniffed lists price only Apprentice, 10c as in Classic). In-game check: what each rank
# costs.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice (1-75)
section Alchemy 1-75

step Learn Alchemy
  tip Apprentice Alchemy lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any Alchemy trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Pair it with Herbalism: Peacebloom and Silverleaf grow in every starting zone, and Empty Vials cost 4c at any alchemy or trade supplies vendor. 1-75 takes about 3s 28c of vendor goods, plus 82 Silverleaf and 110 Peacebloom to gather or buy.
  train Alchemy Apprentice
  skill Alchemy 1

step Alchemy 1-75: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 82 Empty Vial (3s 28c); about 3s 28c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3371 x82 nearest

step Alchemy 1-75: Auction House
  tip What 1-75 takes that the Auction House sells: 82 Silverleaf and 110 Peacebloom. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 765 x82
  auction 2447 x110

