step Elixir of Minor Defense to 75
  zone Azeroth
  tip Elixir of Minor Defense is orange at 1 (yellow 55, green 75, grey 95): about 82 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 Silverleaf, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial. Known from the start and the cheapest way through the Apprentice range. Keep the elixirs (armour while you level) or sell them.
  craft 7183 until 75
  skill Alchemy 75

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Alchemy 75-150

step Journeyman Alchemy
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 4s 50c (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Alchemy trainer teaches it: Alliance Alchemist Narett (Dustwallow Marsh), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Kylanna (Ashenvale), Lilyssia Nightbreeze (Stormwind City), Sylvanna Forestmoon (Darnassus) and Tally Berryfizz (Ironforge); Horde Bena Winterhoof (Thunder Bluff), Doctor Marsh (Undercity), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Serge Hinott (Hillsbrad Foothills) and Yelmak (Orgrimmar). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Minor Mana Potion (from 25, 1s). Also learn Mana Well (1s): Forever's Alchemy camp item, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: Alchemy quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an alchemy trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 1s of recipes and 9s 8c of vendor goods, plus 77 Mageroyal, 152 Briarthorn and 54 Bruiseweed to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Alchemy Journeyman
  learn 2331
  learn 1230564

step Alchemy 75-150: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 77 Empty Vial (3s 8c) and 15 Leaded Vial (6s); about 9s 8c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3371 x77 nearest
  buy 3372 x15 nearest

