step Minor Mana Potion to 90
  zone Azeroth
  tip Minor Mana Potion is yellow at 75 (yellow 65, green 85, grey 105): about 28 crafts to 90. Each takes 1 Mageroyal, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial. The trainer teaches it from 25. It is yellow already, so count on about two crafts a point until Elixir of Wisdom takes over at 90. Mageroyal grows in the 10-25 zones.
  craft 2331 until 90

step Alchemy recipes at 90
  tip Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Wisdom (from 90).
  learn 3171

step Elixir of Wisdom to 135
  tip Elixir of Wisdom is orange at 90 (yellow 120, green 140, grey 160): about 49 crafts to 135. Each takes 1 Mageroyal, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Empty Vial. Two Briarthorn and a Mageroyal a craft, both from the 10-25 zones; orange to 120.
  craft 3171 until 135

step Alchemy recipes at 135
  tip Back to an Alchemy trainer: Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir (from 125).
  learn 3176

step Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir to 150
  tip Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir is orange at 135 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 15 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Two Bruiseweed and two Briarthorn a craft; Bruiseweed grows in the 15-30 zones. Alchemy 150 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 3176 until 150
  skill Alchemy 150

