step Expert Alchemy
  zone Azeroth
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Ainethil (Darnassus); Horde Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 40 Wild Steelbloom, 39 Kingsblood, 39 Stranglekelp and 40 Goldthorn to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Mana Potion (from 160) and Elixir of Defense (from 195), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
  level 20
  train Alchemy Expert

step Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir to 160
  tip Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 12 crafts to 160. Each takes 2 Bruiseweed, 2 Briarthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Two Bruiseweed and two Briarthorn a craft; Bruiseweed grows in the 15-30 zones.
  craft 3176 until 160

step Alchemy recipes at 160
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Mana Potion (from 160).
  learn 3452

step Mana Potion to 195
  tip Mana Potion is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195. Each takes 1 Stranglekelp, 1 Kingsblood and 1 Leaded Vial. Stranglekelp grows under water along the coasts: bring a water breathing elixir or come up for air. Kingsblood grows in the 20-40 zones.
  craft 3452 until 195

step Alchemy recipes at 195
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Elixir of Defense (from 195).
  learn 11450

step Elixir of Defense to 225
  tip Elixir of Defense is orange at 195 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 32 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands). Alchemy 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 11450 until 225
  skill Alchemy 225

