step Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense
  tip Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense teaches Elixir of Greater Defense (Alchemy 265) for 1g 30s. Sold by Alliance: Soolie Berryfizz (Ironforge), limited stock; Horde: Kor'geld (Orgrimmar), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 13478 nearest

step Alchemy 225-300: Auction House
  tip What 225-300 takes that the Auction House sells: 43 Arthas' Tears, 43 Sungrass and 43 Stonescale Eel. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
