step Artisan Alchemy
  zone Azeroth
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kylanna Windwhisper (Feralas); Horde Rogvar (Swamp of Sorrows). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 1g 30s of recipes and 4g 50s 40c of vendor goods, plus 43 Arthas' Tears, 43 Sungrass and 43 Stonescale Eel to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Draught of Detect Undead (from 230) and Stonescale Oil (from 250), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
  level 35
  train Alchemy Artisan

step Elixir of Defense to 230
  tip Elixir of Defense is yellow at 225 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 8 crafts to 230. Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands).
  craft 11450 until 230

step Alchemy recipes at 230
  tip Still at the Artisan trainer: Draught of Detect Undead (from 230).
  learn 11460

step Draught of Detect Undead to 265
  tip Draught of Detect Undead is orange at 230 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 43 crafts to 265. Each takes 1 Arthas' Tears and 1 Crystal Vial. Arthas' Tears grow in the Plaguelands and Felwood (Herbalism 220); Crystal Vials come from alchemy vendors.
  craft 11460 until 265

step Alchemy recipes at 265
  tip Still at the Artisan trainer: Stonescale Oil (from 250).
  learn 17551

step Elixir of Greater Defense to 300
  tip Elixir of Greater Defense is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass and 1 Crystal Vial. Make the 86 Stonescale Oil (43 crafts) first. Stonescale Eel comes from the Stonescale Eel schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 17554 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 17551 x43
  craft 17554 until 300
  skill Alchemy 300
